<!-- content -->
<section id="landing" class="hseek hps">
	<div class="mc">

			<h1>your story</h1>
		
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our students demonstrate the potential to be motivators, leaders, and world-changers. Snead State is the place for you, but don’t solely take our word for it. <strong><a href="https://snead.edu/admissions/campustours/">SCHEDULE A TOUR</a> </strong>and see for yourself why you belong at Snead State.</p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
