<section id="about" class="hseek hps">
		<div class="mc ab container">
		<div class="sib">
			<img src="https://snead.edu/wp-content/themes/snead/images/logo-negative.png" alt="">
		</div>
		<div class="content">
			<h2>about</h2>
			<p>No matter what educational or career path you choose, Snead State is the place to set the foundation for your college career. Snead State Community College offers the complete college experience with quality instruction and an active campus life. Learn more <strong><a href="https://snead.edu/about/">About Snead State</a></strong>.</p>
<p><a href="https://snead.edu/about/operations/business_operations/">FINANCIAL DISCLOSURE</a></p>
